flowchart LR
    Client[Web or Mobile Client] --> Gateway[Ocelot Gateway :5000]

    Gateway --> Auth[AuthService :5001]
    Gateway --> Wallet[WalletService :5002]
    Gateway --> Rewards[RewardsService :5003]
    Gateway --> Admin[AdminService :5004]

    Auth --> AuthDb[(LoyalPayAuthDb)]
    Wallet --> WalletDb[(LoyalPayWalletDb)]
    Rewards --> RewardsDb[(LoyalPayRewardsDb)]
    Admin --> AuthDb
    Admin --> WalletDb
    Admin --> RewardsDb

    Auth -- UserRegisteredEvent --> MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
    Wallet -- TopUpCompletedEvent --> MQ
    MQ --> Wallet
    MQ --> Rewards
